      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LATE IN ARRIVAL (4) ran below best last time finishing fifth (23.22) over 400m at The Gardens in a Free For All. Form here at the trip sound including two wins. Has a strong record out of this box with two wins and a minor placing from four starts. Should be very hard to beat this time. MY MOON SHADOW (1) is drawn well on the inside. Last start finished 4th on August 8 over 400m at The Gardens behind GEORGE JUDY beaten 5.5 lengths (23.21) in a Free For All. Looks well placed here and among the chances. MY WEE LASS (2) was in the money (22.97) last time out at The Gardens after taking advantage of the inside draw. Has been out the placings in all two runs here. Although beaten ran one of the quickest times on the card last start. Overdue and expected to feature again. GEORGE JUDY (3) is always a threat when he races at this track and distance.",
